<p>Ghul hai quraasaa'n me barpa waawaila, utthe jahaa'n se aaj raza waawaila<br />
Koun o makaa'n me hashr hai barpa , roti hai marqad me zahra waawaila</p>

<p>
Zulm o sitam aada ke sahe waawaila, qabre payambar se choote waawaila<br />
chain na paaya ta dame aaqir, kar gaye dukh me aap qaza waawaila</p>

<p>
Naala kuna'n hai paighambar waawaila, rote hai marqad me hyder waawaila<br />
marne se tere dono jahaa'n me, mehshar taaza hai barpa waawaila<br />
</p>